# ==============================================================================
# AI Code Review Bot - Trivy Vulnerability Exception / Allowlist
# ==============================================================================
# Format for temporary, auditable, time-bounded exceptions:
#   <CVE-ID> exp:YYYY-MM-DD # [APPROVER=username] Justification
# Example:
#   CVE-2024-0000 exp:2026-12-31 # [APPROVER=security-lead] Upstream fix pending, risk mitigated by non-root execution
#
# RULES FOR EXCEPTIONS:
# 1. Broad suppression of vulnerability classes is strictly prohibited.
# 2. Every entry must include an explicit, unexpired expiration date (exp:YYYY-MM-DD or [EXPIRY=YYYY-MM-DD]).
# 3. Every entry must include maintainer approval ([APPROVER=username]) and documented justification.
# 4. Once an upstream fix is published, the exception must be removed immediately.
# ==============================================================================
